tem":0},{"seq":560,"uid":564,"modseq":"203","bodyStructure":"204","envelope":"205","id":"206","mailboxPath":"161","textContent":"207"},{"item":0},{"seq":564,"uid":568,"modseq":"208","bodyStructure":"209","envelope":"210","id":"211","mailboxPath":"161","textContent":"212"},{"item":0},{"prompt":"213","historyCount":3},{"item":0},{"response":"214","tokenUsage":"215"},{"messages":"216","estimatedTokens":1594,"options":"217"},{"text":"218"},{"item":0},{"rfc822":"219","subject":"220","draftPreview":"218"},{"item":0},{"destination":"221","path":"221","seq":14,"uidValidity":"222","uid":4883},{"item":0},"helene.berenger@gerflor.com","BERENGER Hélène","MISE EN CONTACT","Bonjour\\n\\n@PEYRONEL Remy<mailto:remy.peyronel@gerflor.com> je te mets en relation avec la société Ebanista qui réalise pour nous les meubles de nos show room\\n\\n@Caufriez Valentin<mailto:v.caufriez@ebanista.fr>\\nA gagné un appel d'offre EDF pour aménagement de constructions mobiles et a besoin d'acheter du sol Bfls1\\nIl nous demande si achat possible en direct ou via quel distributeur\\n\\nPeux-tu le contacter afin de voir quel est le meilleur circuit ?\\n\\nMerci\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nHélène BERENGER\\nCategory Manager\\n\\n[img]+33 6 65 88 35 42\\n[img]+33 6 65 88 35 42\\n\\nhelene.berenger@gerflor.com<mailto:helene.berenger@gerflor.com>\\n[GERFLOR SAS]\\n[linkedin]<https://app.signitic.com/l/ADE5vAAAABA.qRXvpG_PIkQ>\\n[facebook]<https://app.signitic.com/l/ADE5vAAAAA4.y5NsbgQ1boo>\\n[instagram]<https://app.signitic.com/l/ADE5vAAAABI.q1H7nqGNfVk>\\n[youtube]<https://app.signitic.com/l/ADE5vAAAABM.HlefIUzvBZI>\\n\\n[FR - INTL - GTI Neoconnect 2026]\\n[This e-mail message and any attachment hereto are intended only for the above-mentioned recipient(s). Their contents are confidential. If you received this e-mail in error, please notify us immediately, and delete it as well as any attachment, without making any copy, nor disclosing the contents, nor taking any action based thereon. Thank you.  Please consider the environment before printing this e-mail.]\\n\\n","2026-10-23T07:41:28.000Z","<AMBPR08MB6347983001820302C7EE222344FD642@AMBPR08MB634798.eurprd08.prod.outlook.com>","Mise en relation par Hélène Bérenger (Gerflor) : Ebanista a remporté un appel d'offre EDF pour des constructions mobiles et cherche à acheter du sol Bfls1 (Gerflor). Remy Peyronel (Gerflor) doit contacter Valentin pour définir le meilleur circuit d'achat (direct ou distributeur).","prospects","777",{"childNodes":"223","type":"224","parameters":"225"},{"date":"226","subject":"227","from":"228","sender":"229","replyTo":"230","to":"231","inReplyTo":"232","messageId":"233"},"f1711784cbd71b64894b572872a6453c","Sent","Bonjour Helene,\\r\\n\\r\\nCi-joint vous trouverez le plan avec les dimensions des\\r\\nemplacements. \\r\\n\\r\\nBien cordialement, \\r\\n\\r\\nCaufriez Valentin \\r\\n\\r\\nLe 2026-01-17T09:26:02.000+01:00, BERENGER Hélène\\r\\n<helene.berenger@gerflor.com> a écrit :\\r\\n\\r\\n> Avec le doc 😊\\r\\n> \\r\\n>  \\r\\n> \\r\\n>  \\r\\n> \\r\\n> HÉLÈNE BERENGER\\r\\n> CATEGORY MANAGER\\r\\n> \\r\\n> [img]+33 6 65 88 35 42\\r\\n> [img]+33 6 65 88 35 42\\r\\n> \\r\\n> helene.berenger@gerflor.com\\r\\n> \\r\\n> [GERFLOR SAS]\\r\\n> \\r\\n> [linkedin]\\r\\n> [https://app.signitic.com/l/U1pIRHBnUjBLTDh6VlViTUFLMzh1QT09-eFZMaExNZWZGQjMvaVVJaDArTTl6Zz09]\\r\\n> \\r\\n> [facebook]\\r\\n> [https://app.signitic.com/l/U1pIRHBnUjBLTDh6VlViTUFLMzh1QT09-bDh2a2xCS2VaVHRuaUQzenVMaFphUT09]\\r\\n> \\r\\n> [instagram]\\r\\n> [https://app.signitic.com/l/U1pIRHBnUjBLTDh6VlViTUFLMzh1QT09-MVc4eTk5YXpOcDFSNDR3dDdleFhiQT09]\\r\\n> \\r\\n> [youtube]\\r\\n> [https://app.signitic.com/l/U1pIRHBnUjBLTDh6VlViTUFLMzh1QT09-VHU5ZDFDM3h6QXJ6Qm9jSUVjb2Ftdz09]\\r\\n> \\r\\n> [INTL Wishes 2026]\\r\\n> \\r\\n> This e-mail message and any attachment hereto are intended only for\\r\\n> the above-mentioned recipient(s). Their contents are confidential.\\r\\n> If you received this e-mail in error, please notify us immediately,\\r\\n> and de