nsport-crosstenantheadersstripped":"288","x-ms-publictraffictype":"289","x-ms-office365-filtering-correlation-id-prvs":"290","x-microsoft-antispam":"291","x-microsoft-antispam-message-info":"292","x-forefront-antispam-report":"293","x-ms-exchange-antispam-messagedata-chunkcount":"294","x-ms-exchange-antispam-messagedata-0":"295","x-originatororg":"296","x-ms-exchange-crosstenant-originalarrivaltime":"297","x-ms-exchange-crosstenant-network-message-id":"298","x-ms-exchange-crosstenant-id":"299","x-ms-exchange-crosstenant-originalattributedtenantconnectingip":"300","x-ms-exchange-crosstenant-authsource":"301","x-ms-exchange-crosstenant-authas":"302","x-ms-exchange-crosstenant-fromentityheader":"303","x-spam-score":"304","x-spam-detail":"305","x-spam-verdict":"306","x-spam-state":"307","x-infomaniak-type":"308","x-infomaniak-dcc-fuz1":"309","x-infomaniak-dcc-fuz2":"310","x-infomaniak-pyzor-hash":"311","x-infomaniak-spam":"312","x-infomaniak-cause":"313","x-rspamd-queue-id":"314","x-rspamd-server":"315","x-rspamd-action":"316","x-spamd-result":"317"},"<html>\\n<head>\\n<meta http-equiv=\\"Content-Type\\" content=\\"text/html; charset=iso-8859-1\\">\\n<style type=\\"text/css\\" style=\\"display:none;\\"> P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} </style>\\n</head>\\n<body dir=\\"ltr\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nHello Valentin,&nbsp;</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nNous allons soumettre le devis aménagement intérieur + le devis travaux prochainement à notre PDG, en attendant pour que ton devis soit le plus réaliste possible peux-tu stp ajuster cela :&nbsp;</div>\\n<ul data-editing-info=\\"{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:false,&quot;unorderedStyleType&quot;:2}\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<li style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">La table de réunion : plateau en décor bois strat : (réf: EGGER Chene Vicenza H3157ST12), les dimensions : 6000x1500xht 750 ép 100 mm en 3 parties comprenant 3 blocs prises USB et 3 pieds forme ovale structure\\n en acier et recouvert de menuiserie stratifié&nbsp;</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">La table de démo (que tu as appelé dans ton devis table accueil) doit-être en finition stratifié Polyrey B170 blanc Absolu de dimensions 1400x1500x ht 1055 mm en cp ép 100mm avec 2 tiroirs de 1100 x 1400 mm et\\n 400x 1400mm sous plateau se faisant dos et pas de rangement de type niche au niveau des pieds, comme on a SPL</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">Pour tous les meubles, à la différence de SPL les arrêtes du meuble ne doivent pas être visibles, donc en stratifié blanc teinter dans la masse.</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">Sur ton devis je ne vois pas les panneaux dibons dans les corners segments (épaisseur : 3mm, Visuel sport : 600 x Ht 2380 mm et Visuel TRANSPORT : 600 x Ht 2500 mm)</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">Pour l'espace WCWA, peux-tu stp prendre en compte cela :&nbsp; 1 podium de 1450x900x ht 120 mm + 1 meuble suspendu de 1450x600x ht 400 mm avec 2 portes Push + 1 visuel cadre alu + toile tendu</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">Colonnes de cartes entre les corners segments : meuble méla blanc chant pvc Polyrey B170 blanc Absolu : Dimensions 360x900x ht2500mm, 2 caissons pour carte selon plan + 1porte push avec\\n 1 niche au dessus.</div>\\n</li></ul>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nMerci beaucoup</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nBonne journée à toi !</div>\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\"><br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div id=\\"Signature\\" class=\\"elementToProof\\">\\n<table cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" border=\\"0\\" style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td style=\\"direction: ltr;\\">\\n<table cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; line-height: 1.2; display: inline-table; width: 487px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2; border-width: 0px 0px 3px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255) rgb(255, 255, 255) rgb(11, 31, 80); padding-bottom: 10px; width: 487px;\\">\\n<table cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2; width: 487px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0px;\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2; border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); width: 487px;\\">\\n<table cellspacing=\\"0\\" cellpadding=\\"0\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2; width: 487px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0px;\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; line-height: 1.2; border-width: 0px; border-style: none; border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); width: 268px; height: 18px;\\">\\n<p class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; line-height: 1; margin: 0px;\\">\\n<span style=\\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(15, 21, 83);\\"><b