ts restants sans réponse, notamment :</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<ul data-editing-info=\\"{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:false,&quot;unorderedStyleType&quot;:2}\\" style=\\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\">Décision finale quant à la destination du groupe extérieur</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\">Extincteur : Limites de prestation, pas de notre compétence</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\">Armoire électrique : Avez-vous des dimensions en tête ? Que prévoyez-vous de mettre dedans ?</div>\\n</li></ul>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nVoici les créneaux auxquels Valentin CAUFRIEZ, notre aménageur EBANISTA et moi-même sommes disponibles :</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nNous suggérons un RDV Teams, mais nous pouvons également nous déplacer dans vos locaux ou vous-mêmes revenir à VALAURIE.&nbsp;</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<table id=\\"table_0\\" data-editing-info=\\"{&quot;topBorderColor&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;,&quot;bottomBorderColor&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;,&quot;verticalBorderColor&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;,&quot;hasHeaderRow&quot;:false,&quot;hasFirstColumn&quot;:false,&quot;hasBandedRows&quot;:false,&quot;hasBandedColumns&quot;:false,&quot;bgColorEven&quot;:null,&quot;bgColorOdd&quot;:&quot;#EEEEEE&quot;,&quot;headerRowColor&quot;:&quot;#ABABAB&quot;,&quot;tableBorderFormat&quot;:0,&quot;verticalAlign&quot;:null}\\" style=\\"margin-bottom: 1px; box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td style=\\"border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-right: 7.2px; padding-left: 7.2px; width: 276.25px; height: 40.75px; min-width: 15px; box-sizing: border-box;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<b>CRENEAUX DE DISPONIBILITÉS UNITECH</b></div>\\n</td>\\n<td style=\\"border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding-right: 7.2px; padding-left: 7.2px; width: 162.469px; height: 40.75px; min-width: 15px; box-sizing: border-box;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\\">\\n<b>PLAGES HORAIRES</b></div>\\n</td>\\n<td style=