ptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\">\\n<span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\">\\n<span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"background-color: white; margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\">\\n<span class=\\"spanWithBackgroundColor\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black; background-color: white;\\">Cordialement,</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\\"><b>Ludivine SAUZADE</b></span></p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);\\">Adjointe de Direction / CST Classes 2 à 9 / Responsable BU Négoce et Services</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\">&nbsp;</p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: black;\\"><b>UNITECH Services France SAS</b></span></p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\\"><span style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: black;\\"><b>Mob:</b>     +&nbsp; 33 7 69 13 71 47</span></p>\\n<p style=\\"margin: 0px; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size