class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<span class=\\"spanWithBackgroundColor\\" style=\\"background-color: yellow;\\"><b><u>1/ Conteneur &quot;BUREAU&quot;</u></b></span></div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<ul data-editing-info=\\"{&quot;applyListStyleFromLevel&quot;:false,&quot;unorderedStyleType&quot;:2}\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">\\nQuantité :                 1 conteneur 20'DRY</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">\\nDimensions intérieures :     5.90 x 2.35 x 2.39 M</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">\\nSurface extérieure :         14.70 m<sup>2</sup></div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">\\nVolume intérieur :          33.13 m<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">\\nAménagement :             Ce conteneur sera aménagé selon le schéma à main levée ci-joint, réalisé en réunion d'enclenchement par AMT --&gt; Merci de poser la clim à l'endroit schématisé sur le plan en PJ.</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">\\nLieu de pose :             &nbsp; VALAURIE (Soit chez UNITECH, soit chez EBANISTA)</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; list-style-type: &quot;- &quot;;\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">\\nDate de pose :&nbsp;             Nous sommes censés livrer ce conteneur à AMT PONT SAINT ESPRIT pour le 31/12, mais vu le retard déjà pris, je crains que ta date d'intervention soit plutôt en janvier-février 2027</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n</li></ul>\\n</blockquote>\\n</blockquote>\\n<div id=\\"Signature\\" class=\\"elementToProof\\">\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n***************************************************************************************************</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nLe <span class=\\"spanWithBackgroundColor\\" style=\\"background-color: rgb(0, 255, 0);\\">\\n26/08</span>, nous avons reçu le Cahier des charges suivant :&nbsp;</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<img style=\\"max-width: 2352px;\\" size=\\"11990\\" data-outlook-trace=\\"F:1|T:1\\" src=\\"data:image/png;base64,\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n**************************************************************************************************</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\"elementToProof\\" style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\\">\\nPuis le <span class=\\"spanWithBackground