limatisation Mitsubishi electric HR25, le prix est de 1800€ TTC.<br>\\n</div>\\n<div><br>\\n</div>\\n<div>Cordialement&nbsp;</div>\\n<div><br>\\n</div>\\n<div>Envoyé depuis l'application Mail Orange<br>\\n</div>\\n<div><br>\\n</div>\\n<div><br>\\n</div>\\n<div>----------------<br>\\n</div>\\n<div><b>De :</b> &quot;L. Sauzade - UniTech&quot; &lt;<a href=\\"mailto:lsauzade@unitecheu.com\\" id=\\"OWA726e1c68-d2d1-fbe5-7585-bb2627e15b8f\\" class=\\"OWAAutoLink\\">lsauzade@unitecheu.com</a>&gt;<br>\\n</div>\\n<div><b>Envoyé :</b> mercredi 21 octobre 2026 11:11<br>\\n</div>\\n<div><b>À :</b> M SAUZADE FLORIAN &lt;<a href=\\"mailto:sauzadeflorianlison@orange.fr\\" id=\\"OWA3da9d0fb-b659-bc4f-606f-b79447f4c935\\" class=\\"OWAAutoLink\\">sauzadeflorianlison@orange.fr</a>&gt;<br>\\n</div>\\n<div><b>Cc :</b> Caufriez Valentin &lt;<a href=\\"mailto:v.caufriez@ebanista.fr\\" id=\\"OWA4556b498-7603-4197-4c79-51c02ec806d7\\" class=\\"OWAAutoLink\\">v.caufriez@ebanista.fr</a>&gt;<br>\\n</div>\\n<div><b>Objet :</b> NLC-2025-074_010-AMTPON-26 : Demande de prix installation clim 1 conteneur 20' &quot;BUREAU&quot;<br>\\n</div>\\n<div><br>\\n</div>\\n<div><br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">\\nBonjour,<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">\\nPeux-tu m'indiquer ton prix pour la fourniture et la pose d'une clim, selon détails ci-dessous :<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<blockquote>\\n<blockquote>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">\\n<span class=\\"spanWithBackgroundColor\\" style=\\"background-color: yellow;\\"><b><u>1/ Conteneur &quot;BUREAU&quot;</u></b></span><br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<ul style=\\"direction: ltr; text-align: left; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">Quantité :                 1 conteneur 20'DRY<br>\\n</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">Dimensions intérieures :     5.90 x 2.35 x 2.39 M<br>\\n</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">Surface extérieure :         14.70 m<sup>2</sup><br>\\n</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">Volume intérieur :          33.13 m<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;<br>\\n</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">Aménagement :             Ce conteneur sera aménagé selon le schéma à main levée ci-joint, réalisé en réunion d'enclenchement par AMT --&gt; Merci de poser la clim à l'endroit schématisé sur le\\n plan en PJ.<br>\\n</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">Lieu de pose :             &nbsp; VALAURIE (Soit chez UNITECH, soit chez EBANISTA)<br>\\n</div>\\n</li><li style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\\">\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\">Date de pose :&nbsp;             Nous sommes censés livrer ce conteneur à AMT PONT SAINT ESPRIT pour le 31/12, mais vu le retard déjà pris, je crains que ta date d'intervention soit plutôt en janvier-février\\n 2027<br>\\n</div>\\n<div role=\\"presentation\\" style=\\"direction: ltr; text-indent: 0px;\\"><br>\\n</div>\\n</li></ul>\\n</blockquote>\\n</blockquote>\\n<div id=\\"x_Signature\\">\\n<div style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">\\n***************************************************************************************************<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">\\nLe <span class=\\"spanWithBackgroundColor\\" style=\\"background-color: lime;\\">26/08</span>, nous avons reçu le Cahier des charges suivant :&nbsp;<br>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Trebuchet, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: black;\\">\\n<img id=\\"x_22f9