3 03\\nARLU - Ter Vlucht 2 - 8850 Ardooie - Belgium \\nThis e-mail may contain confidential and/or privileged information. If you are not the intended recipient (or have received this e-mail in error) please notify the sender immediately and destroy this e-mail. Any unauthorised copying, disclosure or distribution of the material in this e-mail is strictly forbidden. Warning: Although the company has taken reasonable precautions to ensure no viruses are present in this email,the company cannot accept responsibility for any loss or damage arising from the use of this email or attachments.\\n","2026-10-19T14:31:20.000Z","<DU2PR01MB828028A4D75A379033153E8A89982@DU2PR01MB8280.eurprd01.prod.exchangelabs.com>","Le responsable commercial d'ARLU propose à Ebanista de devenir « Partenaire Divina », avec des remises (45% sur le configurateur, 60% pour le showroom), une présence sur leur carte partenaires France et la transmission de demandes clients sur le secteur.","offre_fournisseur","954",{"childNodes":"159","type":"160","parameters":"161"},{"date":"162","subject":"163","from":"164","sender":"165","replyTo":"166","to":"167","messageId":"168"},"daeb88b72b081125846c769d050fd851","Sent","Bonjour Raffi, \\r\\n\\r\\nPour revenir au chantier Colonzelle, je te transmet les dimensions: \\r\\n\\r\\nDimension de passage de la porte pivotante: H 2505  - L 1105 mm\\r\\n\\r\\nDimension de passage de la verrière avec double coulissant: H 2500 -\\r\\nL 3675 mm \\r\\nPour rappel, le rail est fixé sur l'imposte en placo pour aligner les\\r\\ncadres. \\r\\n\\r\\nPeux tu me mettre a jour les offres ? \\r\\n\\r\\nJe te remercie, \\r\\n\\r\\nCordialement, \\r\\n\\r\\nValentin \\r\\n\\r\\n","975",{"childNodes":"169","type":"160","parameters":"170"},{"date":"171","subject":"172","from":"173","sender":"174","replyTo":"175","to":"176","inReplyTo":"177","messageId":"178"},"1961adf98ea614ffbf6473e671a294db","Pour les parcloses: la porte pivotante a deux parcloses sur la largeur\\r\\nde la porte (vis